[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2439432768","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98520#issuecomment-2439432768","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98520","id":2439432768,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RZspA","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-26T08:35:02Z","updated_at":"2024-10-26T08:35:02Z","body":"> As written in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90338, all .csproj files must be in the folder with the .sln file.\r\n\r\nI don't quite understand which comment in that PR has led to this conclusion; I can only extract the point that \"All `.cs` source files must be in the project folder.\" The `csproj` is another thing that should not be confused with the `.cs` file.\r\n\r\nThat aside, how do we resolve the ScriptPath for the types that live inside a `DLL`? They may even come from Nuget packages.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2439432768/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2439488895","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98520#issuecomment-2439488895","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98520","id":2439488895,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RZ6V_","user":{"login":"wezwery","id":78137706,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTM3NzA2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78137706?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wezwery","html_url":"https://github.com/wezwery","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wezwery/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wezwery/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wezwery/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wezwery/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wezwery/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wezwery/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wezwery/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wezwery/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wezwery/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-26T10:53:44Z","updated_at":"2024-10-26T11:12:02Z","body":"What if we add the ability to set your own initial path to files in csproj?\r\n\r\nSomething like this:\r\n```xml\r\n<PropertyGroup>\r\n    <PathPrefix>game</PathPrefix>\r\n</PropertyGroup>\r\n```\r\nExample of a path with a prefix:\r\n```\r\ngame://GameScene.tscn\r\n```\r\n\r\nThere may be conflicts here, for example user://","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2439488895/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2439549486","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98520#issuecomment-2439549486","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98520","id":2439549486,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RaJIu","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-26T11:52:26Z","updated_at":"2024-10-26T11:53:38Z","body":">What if we add the ability to set your own initial path to files in csproj?\r\n>Something like this:\r\n\r\nThis will work, however it may produce unresolvable conflict in PathPrefix between DLLs, as authors can freely choose their wording on paths.\r\n\r\nAs discussed in that PR before, one of our thoughts is to use `csharp://full.namespace.to.class` as the absolute path for `C#` scripts, which would be the best solution so far (full path to a type is very unlikely to collide, and the project won't compile neither)\r\n\r\nHowever, such change may be too much for the existing `GodotSharp`, or the `mono` module, [quote](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90338#issuecomment-2041570257) from Raul:\r\n\r\n> changing the script paths to a virtual path (e.g.: dotnet:// or csharp://) would be a pretty big breaking change, and I don't really want to make big changes to the scripting API right now. I belive the goal for the scripting API should be to stabilize, so existing users can keep using it without worry and users that are looking for exciting new features can look at the new [GDExtension-based bindings](https://github.com/raulsntos/godot-dotnet).\r\n\r\nPlease note that this new binding is still in the early stages and not ready for any formal project.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2439549486/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460399353","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98520#issuecomment-2460399353","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98520","id":2460399353,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Sprb5","user":{"login":"haltingstate","id":1774230,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzQyMzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1774230?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/haltingstate","html_url":"https://github.com/haltingstate","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haltingstate/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haltingstate/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haltingstate/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haltingstate/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haltingstate/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haltingstate/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haltingstate/repos","events_url":"https://